    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:osvedomitel_ugroza_phrase_2#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1895,
      "string_id": "osvedomitel_ugroza_phrase_2",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "And the evidence?",
      "JA_current": "で、証拠は？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "osvedomitel_ugroza",
          "phrase_id": "1",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:osvedomitel_ugroza_phrase_3#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1898,
      "string_id": "osvedomitel_ugroza_phrase_3",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I don't know what you mean... You don't believe me?",
      "JA_current": "証拠って何のことだ……俺の言葉が信じられないのか？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "osvedomitel_ugroza",
          "phrase_id": "2",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:osvedomitel_ugroza_phrase_4#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1901,
      "string_id": "osvedomitel_ugroza_phrase_4",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "All right, to hell with you. We're serious people, so let's get right to the point. I've got some information about your strangers, and it's very detailed. Who they are, names, nicknames, exact location, the latest information. You want it?",
      "JA_current": "ケッ、もういい、シラを切るな。俺たちも暇じゃないんだ、単刀直入にいこうぜ。お前が追ってる余所者どもについて、かなり詳しいネタを掴んでる。奴らの正体、名前、あだ名、正確な潜伏場所、最新の動向まで全部だ。欲しいだろ？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "osvedomitel_ugroza",
          "phrase_id": "3",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:osvedomitel_ugroza_phrase_5#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1904,
      "string_id": "osvedomitel_ugroza_phrase_5",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Of course you are! I'm listening to you carefully.",
      "JA_current": "当たり前だ！ ちゃんと聞くから話してくれ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "osvedomitel_ugroza",
          "phrase_id": "4",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:osvedomitel_ugroza_phrase_6#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1907,
      "string_id": "osvedomitel_ugroza_phrase_6",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I already told you that information is money now! In short, this information will cost you 10,000 rubles.",
      "JA_current": "前に言ったろ、今や情報は金なんだよ！ 要するに、このネタは1万ルーブルだ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "osvedomitel_ugroza",
          "phrase_id": "5",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:osvedomitel_ugroza_phrase_7#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1910,
      "string_id": "osvedomitel_ugroza_phrase_7",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "That's a lot of money. I hope it's worth it!",
      "JA_current": "大金だな……それだけの価値があるんだろうな！",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "osvedomitel_ugroza",
          "phrase_id": "6",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:osvedomitel_ugroza_phrase_8#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1913,
      "string_id": "osvedomitel_ugroza_phrase_8",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Of course, I guarantee it. Well, how about it?",
      "JA_current": "当然だ、保証するぜ。さあ、どうする？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "osvedomitel_ugroza",
          "phrase_id": "7",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:osvedomitel_ugroza_phrase_9#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1916,
      "string_id": "osvedomitel_ugroza_phrase_9",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Give me your information. Here's the money:",
      "JA_current": "情報をくれ。ほら、金だ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "osvedomitel_ugroza",
          "phrase_id": "8",
